### Product image upload (201; Admin/Manager)
# @name uploadProductImage
POST {{host}}/api/products/{{findMacbook.response.body.$.items[0].id}}/images
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=TechStoreImage

--TechStoreImage
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="pixel.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ./samples/pixel.png
--TechStoreImage--

### Product image layout (200; every current image exactly once)
PUT {{host}}/api/products/{{findMacbook.response.body.$.items[0].id}}/images/layout
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "items": [{ "id": "{{uploadProductImage.response.body.$.id}}", "variantId": null }] }

### Product image delete (204)
DELETE {{host}}/api/products/{{findMacbook.response.body.$.items[0].id}}/images/{{uploadProductImage.response.body.$.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.$.accessToken}}
